Assignment 9: Multi-Region S3 Replication with Failover
Task:
Setup active-passive S3 replication with automatic failover testing.
What to Do:
●    Create S3 bucket in us-east-1 (primary)
●    Enable versioning on primary bucket
●    Create second bucket in eu-west-1 (replica)
●    Configure S3 Cross-Region Replication (CRR)
●    Add replication rules for:
●    All objects with prefix "critical/"
●    Only objects tagged "replicate: true"
●    Create CloudWatch alarm monitoring replication metrics
●    Upload 20 files and verify replication
●    Delete object in primary, verify delete marker replicates
●    Test replication lag with large files (500MB)
●    Calculate RTO by simulating primary region failure
Success Criteria:
●    Replication happens within 15 minutes
●    Delete markers replicate correctly
●    Can retrieve objects from replica during "primary failure"